  "body": "## What's Changed\n* build(deps): bump pyasn1 from 0.6.3 to 0.6.4 in the uv group across 1 directory by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/alDuncanson/Handler/pull/87\n* build(deps): bump aiohttp from 3.14.1 to 3.14.3 in the uv group across 1 directory by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/alDuncanson/Handler/pull/90\n* build(deps): bump cryptography from 48.0.1 to 50.0.0 in the uv group across 1 directory by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/alDuncanson/Handler/pull/91\n* feat!: remove the built-in Handler agent by @alDuncanson in https://github.com/alDuncanson/Handler/pull/92\n* chore: address follow-ups from the built-in agent removal by @alDuncanson in https://github.com/alDuncanson/Handler/pull/93\n* docs: drop remaining built-in agent references by @alDuncanson in https://github.com/alDuncanson/Handler/pull/96\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/alDuncanson/Handler/compare/v0.1.26...v0.2.0",
